{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50307","headline":"晚次白水古戍见枯骨之作 · 佚名","name":"晚次白水古戍见枯骨之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深山古戍寂无人，崩壁荒丘接鬼邻。\n意气丹诚□□□，惟余白骨变灰尘。\n汉家封垒徒千所，失守时更历几春。\n此日覊愁肠自断，□□到此转悲辛（原作「新」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}